{"ID":"20240506110122-n87b35c","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506110122-n87b35c","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110122-n87b35c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110122-vggtjvg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110122-vggtjvg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110122-vggtjvg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"342贝子（贝齿）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828090044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240703115735-fxjgvyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703115735-fxjgvyv","updated":"20240828085250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 374px;","style":"width: 364px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贝子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贝子-20240703115735-wl13my4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 364px;\" parent-style=\"width: 374px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828085750-two6q2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828085750-two6q2y","updated":"20240828085750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 373px;","style":"width: 363px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贝子2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贝子2-20240703125210-xjqyri3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 363px;\" parent-style=\"width: 373px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828085411-29swjn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828085411-29swjn7","updated":"20240828085420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 698px;","style":"width: 688px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贝子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贝子-20240828085411-jt2krn8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 688px;\" parent-style=\"width: 698px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828085911-p1iquwt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828085911-p1iquwt","updated":"20240828085911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 359px;","style":"width: 349px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"货贝3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/货贝3-20240703115846-spskdqu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 349px;\" parent-style=\"width: 359px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 699px;","style":"width: 689px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贝子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贝子 2-20240828085848-86hatzx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 689px;\" parent-style=\"width: 699px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828085755-tak2ejd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828085755-tak2ejd","updated":"20240828085917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 504px;","style":"width: 494px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贝齿3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贝齿3-20240703125710-a2u697l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 494px;\" parent-style=\"width: 504px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 578px;","style":"width: 568px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贝子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贝子 1-20240828085524-sp4t0nn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 568px;\" parent-style=\"width: 578px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828090044-fahuch2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828090044-fahuch2","updated":"20240828090044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 1083px;","style":"width: 1073px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贝子 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贝子 3-20240828090044-awreie2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1073px;\" parent-style=\"width: 1083px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240613174254-6zufkd3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613174254-6zufkd3"}},{"ID":"20240613174314-hmjkl6f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613174314-hmjkl6f","updated":"20240613174320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613174314-wi0j89i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613174314-wi0j89i","updated":"20240613174314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸平。"}]},{"ID":"20240613174314-ekzvh2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613174314-ekzvh2f","updated":"20240613174314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主目翳，鬼注，虫毒，腹痛，下血，五癃，利水道，烧用之良。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613174314-stp39ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613174314-stp39ws","updated":"20240613174314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名贝齿，生东海。"}]},{"ID":"20240613174314-6jm8ybw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613174314-6jm8ybw","updated":"20240613174314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：贝，海介虫也，居陆名飙。在水名，象形，《尔雅》云：贝小者。郭璞云：今细贝，亦有紫色，出日南，又，小而椭。郭璞云：即上小贝。"}]},{"ID":"20240613174254-p3588ri","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613174254-p3588ri"}},{"ID":"20240613174256-t15ihes","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613174256-t15ihes","updated":"20240613174303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613174256-xov70rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613174256-xov70rw","updated":"20240613174256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，平，有毒。主目翳，鬼疰，蛊毒，腹痛下血，五癃，利水道。除寒热温疰，解肌，散结热。烧用之良。一名贝齿。生东海池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613174256-4x64rj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613174256-4x64rj7","updated":"20240613174256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此是今小小贝子，人以饰军容服物者，乃出南海。烧作细屑末，以吹眼中，疗翳良。又真马珂捣末，亦疗盲翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173946-rap2whf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173946-rap2whf"}},{"ID":"20240613174206-oklka4x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613174206-oklka4x","updated":"20240613174212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫贝《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240613174206-gdm4j8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613174206-gdm4j8k","updated":"20240613174206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（蚌蛤）利水通道逐蛊下血"}]},{"ID":"20240613174206-zasimbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613174206-zasimbu","updated":"20240613174206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫贝（专入脾肝）。即贝子之色赤者也。味咸气平。其物出于云南。白入气。紫入血。（紫斑而骨白。）功专利水通道。逐蛊下血。凡人症患香港脚。小儿斑疹目翳。五癃水肿。蛊毒鬼蛀。用此的能解除。盖因咸有软坚之力。脚症湿热。用此得以透骨逐邪。（贝骨坚硬。故能透骨。）和以诸药。使其蒸蒸作汗次第而解也。目翳用此粉点。亦以能除湿热而使血得上营。但与贝子相类甚多。如砑蠃之类皆能相混。分别用之。（颂曰。贝类极多。古人以为宝货。而紫贝尤贵。后世不用贝钱。而药中亦希使之。）背上深紫有黑点者良。生研细末用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173946-sqr6znm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173946-sqr6znm"}},{"ID":"20240613173947-b8d35ol","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173947-b8d35ol","updated":"20240613173952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173947-ohk6km3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173947-ohk6km3","updated":"20240613173947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子解肌散结热，利水消肿浮，去男妇赤目生翳无休，点上即愈，涂孩子疳蚀吐乳不止，服下立安，鬼疰善驱，蛊毒并解。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173729-nw0dxj5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173729-nw0dxj5"}},{"ID":"20240613173931-0g2j45p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173931-0g2j45p","updated":"20240613173940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173931-eqphpeh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173931-eqphpeh","updated":"20240613173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有毒，主除寒热温疰，解肌，散结热。一名贝齿。生东海。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173931-tsn0lhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173931-tsn0lhu","updated":"20240613173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文：贝子，味咸，平。主目翳，鬼注蛊毒，腹痛下血，五癃，利水道。烧用之良。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173729-jtzzcom","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173729-jtzzcom"}},{"ID":"20240613173916-uu6wxwv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173916-uu6wxwv","updated":"20240613173922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173916-kntf79e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173916-kntf79e","updated":"20240613173916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸平小毒。烧赤捣细如面，以清酒淘过用。白者入气分，紫者入血分，花者兼入血气。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173916-np3w5ar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173916-np3w5ar","updated":"20240613173916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主目翳五癃利水道，鬼疰虫毒，腹痛下血。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173916-wyu5eck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173916-wyu5eck","updated":"20240613173916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝生南海，云南极多，土人用为钱货交易。因其味咸软坚，故《本经》专主目翳，其治五癃等病，取咸润走血之力。《千金》香港脚丸中用之，专取咸能破坚之意，虽数十年之疾，靡不克效，以其透入骨空搜逐湿淫之气，和诸药蒸蒸作汗，次第而解也。古方点目用贝子粉入龙脑少许，有息肉加珍珠末吹点，亦入老翳诸方。紫贝治小儿 疹、目翳。今人用以砑纸谓之砑蠃，大者曰珂，亦名马轲螺。治目消翳，去筋膜 肉与贝子相类，分紫、白，灰用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173729-ahdn504","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173729-ahdn504"}},{"ID":"20240613173903-1ofdfxl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173903-1ofdfxl","updated":"20240613173907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173903-2qgxmgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173903-2qgxmgy","updated":"20240613173903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今谓之贝齿，亦如紫贝，但长寸余，故曰贝子。色微白，有深紫黑者，治目中翳，烧用。北人用之毡帽上为饰及缀衣，或作蹀躞下垂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173729-4gcyfz6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173729-4gcyfz6"}},{"ID":"20240613173852-t67bdst","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173852-t67bdst","updated":"20240613173859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173852-qyia1lb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173852-qyia1lb","updated":"20240613173852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，平，有毒。主目翳鬼疰，蛊毒腹痛，下血，五癃，利水道。除寒热温疰，解肌，散结热，烧用之良。一名贝齿。生东海池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173729-aixvumv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173729-aixvumv"}},{"ID":"20240613173837-xbqwmpi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173837-xbqwmpi","updated":"20240613173844"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173837-n9u5l7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173837-n9u5l7t","updated":"20240613173837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，平，有毒。主目翳，鬼疰蛊毒，腹痛下血，五癃，利水道，除寒热温疰，解肌，散结热。烧用，良。《药性论》云∶贝子，使。破五淋，利小便。治伤寒狂热。日华子云∶贝齿，凉。治翳障并鬼毒蛊气。下血。《海药》云∶主水气浮肿，孩子疳蚀及吐乳，并烧用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173729-pe0fy43","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173729-pe0fy43"}},{"ID":"20240613173824-mmck78c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173824-mmck78c","updated":"20240613173830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173824-snkadmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173824-snkadmy","updated":"20240613173824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，气平。有毒。一名贝齿，亦产海涯。皆紫黑蜗壳略同，腹洁白鱼齿近似。画者每用砑纸，婴儿常带压惊。（俗又呼压惊螺。）上古珍之，以为宝货，故贿赂贡赋尝赐。凡属于货者，字皆从贝，意有在矣。至今云南犹作钱用，盖亦不违古也。医家入药，制法须知，醋蜜等分，和蒸清酒，淘净研末。解肌散结热，利水消肿浮。去男妇赤目生翳无休，点上即愈；除孩子疳蚀吐乳不止，服下立安。鬼疰善驱，蛊毒并解。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173729-snljp1a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173729-snljp1a"}},{"ID":"20240613173811-e483mc5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173811-e483mc5","updated":"20240613173818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173811-sd95v68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173811-sd95v68","updated":"20240613173811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，平，有毒。主目翳，鬼疰，蛊毒，腹痛下血，五癃，利水道，除寒热温疰，解肌，散结热。烧用之良。一名贝齿。生东海池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173811-43qijtb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173811-43qijtb","updated":"20240613173811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶此是今小小贝子，人以饰军容服物者，乃出南海。烧作细屑末，以吹眼中，疗翳良。又真马珂捣末，亦疗盲翳。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶蜗类也，形若鱼，齿洁者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173811-gh07gue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173811-gh07gue","updated":"20240613173811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药性论云∶贝子，使。能破五淋，利小便，治伤寒狂热。日华子云∶贝齿，凉。治翳障并鬼毒，鬼气，下血。又名白贝。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173811-qgqb617","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173811-qgqb617","updated":"20240613173811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶贝子，生东海池泽，今南海亦有之。贝类之最小者，又若蜗状。而《交州记》曰∶大贝出日南，如酒杯；小贝，贝齿也。善治毒，俱有紫色是也。洁白如鱼齿，故一名贝齿。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173811-12gnefk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173811-12gnefk","updated":"20240613173811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"古人用以饰军容服物，今稀用，但穿之与小儿戏 头家以饰鉴带，画家亦或使砑物。采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173811-1epv1jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173811-1epv1jx","updated":"20240613173811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"珂亦似此而大，黄黑色，其骨白，可以饰马。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173811-k37o0vv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173811-k37o0vv","updated":"20240613173811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海药云∶云南极多，用为钱货易。主水气浮肿及孩子疳蚀，吐乳。并烧过入药中用。雷公云凡使，勿用花虫壳，其二味相似，只是用之无效。凡使，先用苦酒与蜜相对秤，二味相和了，将贝齿于酒、蜜中蒸，取出，却于清酒中淘令净，研用。圣惠方治射罔在诸肉中有毒及漏脯毒。用贝子末，水调半钱服，效。或食面 毒，亦同用。千金方点小儿黑花眼翳，涩痛。用贝齿一两烧作灰，研如面，入少龙脑，点之妙。又方∶去目翳。贝子十枚，烧灰细筛，取一胡豆大，着翳上，卧如炊一石米久乃灭。息肉者加珍珠与贝子等分。孙真人治食物中毒。取贝子一枚，含，自吐。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173811-2itwhhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173811-2itwhhy","updated":"20240613173811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰贝子，今谓之贝齿，亦如紫贝，但长寸余，故曰贝子。色微白，有深紫黑者，治目中翳，烧用。北人用之毡帽上为饰及缀衣，或作蹀躞下垂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173729-m6wkwtp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173729-m6wkwtp"}},{"ID":"20240613173801-5jn6pb5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173801-5jn6pb5","updated":"20240613173805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173801-om13jdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173801-om13jdf","updated":"20240613173801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」贝齿、白贝、海。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173801-sxxwr4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173801-sxxwr4j","updated":"20240613173801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」咸、平、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173801-5935wve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173801-5935wve","updated":"20240613173801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240613173801-ytqxfpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173801-ytqxfpg","updated":"20240613173801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、目花翳痛。有贝子一两，烧研成粉，加龙脑少许点眼。若有息肉，再加真珠末等分。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173801-37i320f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173801-37i320f","updated":"20240613173801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、鼻渊脓血。用贝子烧研，每服二钱，酒送下。一天服三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173801-e0kzd8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173801-e0kzd8x","updated":"20240613173801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、大便不通。用贝子三个、甘遂一钱五分，共研为末，浆水调下，不久即通。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173801-n0r116y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173801-n0r116y","updated":"20240613173801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小便不通。用贝子一对，一个生用，一个烧过，共研为末，温酒送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173801-t0l7lw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173801-t0l7lw5","updated":"20240613173801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、下疳阴疮。用贝子三个，煅红，研为末，搽患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173729-vjkjfik","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173729-vjkjfik"}},{"ID":"20240613173751-h7gl65n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173751-h7gl65n","updated":"20240613173756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173751-j1ijsf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173751-j1ijsf5","updated":"20240613173751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出东海，洁白如鱼齿。古人用以饰军服，云南用为钱货易。味咸，平，有毒。主点目翳，去鬼疰蛊毒、腹痛下血，破五淋，利水道，消浮肿，除寒热温疟，解肌散结热，杀饮食中毒，小儿疳蚀吐乳。入药，酒洗火 ，细研水飞用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173729-pflbamj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173729-pflbamj"}},{"ID":"20240613173730-awmtll7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-awmtll7","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝子"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-qblhtvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-qblhtvl","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-l1ge0wz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-l1ge0wz","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bèi Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-45tq04a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-45tq04a","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-5jfq7c8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-5jfq7c8","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 贝齿（《雷公炮炙论》），白贝（《日华子本草》），白海蚆（《简便单方》），白贝齿（《药材资料汇编》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-a22tmmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-a22tmmw","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-07ypvuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-07ypvuo","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-gcmmdv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-gcmmdv1","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-4l0h2v5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-4l0h2v5","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为宝贝科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"货贝"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"环纹货贝"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"贝壳"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。5～7月间于海边捞取，除去肉，洗净晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-1wr6pz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-1wr6pz3","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-d7q87bl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-d7q87bl","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 产于海南岛、西沙群岛等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-vnow4bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-vnow4bc","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-yxnivan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-yxnivan","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①货贝（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-1gn7wlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-1gn7wlr","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝壳小型坚固，略成卵圆形；壳长约2.8厘米，宽2厘米左右，高1～1.4厘米。背部中央高凸，两侧坚厚而低平，后方两侧有钝的结节；贝壳表面被珐琅质，有光泽，呈鲜黄色、黄白色或稍带灰绿色，两侧缘色较淡；背部具2～3条灰绿色横带及不明显的橘红色细环纹。螺层完全为珐琅质遮盖，背线不明显。基都平，黄白色，壳口狭长，附近白色；内外两唇周缘，各有细白的齿约12～14个。体柔软，可全部缩入壳内。外套膜两侧伸展呈片状，向背面卷转包住贝壳，上有许多分枝的触手。头宽，吻短，触角长而尖，眼突出，位于触角的外侧；足部发达。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-xb08es9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-xb08es9","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生活于潮间带中潮区的珊瑚礁间，潮退后多隐藏在石块下及珊瑚礁洞穴内。分布南海一带。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-fpgvdy1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-fpgvdy1","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②环纹货贝"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-yh6k1an","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-yh6k1an","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贝壳呈卵圆形，长约2.8厘米，宽约1.9厘米，高约1.3厘米。贝壳背部周围有一橘黄色的环纹，环纹内通常为淡灰蓝色或淡褐色，环纹外为灰褐色或灰白色。基部白色。壳口两唇缘齿各约12个左右。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-diinx9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-diinx9y","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分布南海-带。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-tag6s18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-tag6s18","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-hhaatwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-hhaatwk","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全体略呈卵圆形，长约2.5厘米左右，宽1.5～2厘米，高1厘米余。表面光滑，黄色、黄白色、灰绿色。背部有横带及不明显的橘红色环纹，有的背部灰蓝色，周围有橘黄色环纹。壳口两唇周缘有齿12枚以上。质坚硬.气无，味淡。以个小、色白、壳厚、不碎者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-bh19b1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-bh19b1n","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-81nzk8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-81nzk8j","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 贝齿：洗净晒干，捣碎。煅贝齿：取洗净的贝齿，置坩埚中，入炉火煅红，取出放冷，捣碎即成。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-i5ivyh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-i5ivyh7","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《雷公炮炙论》：\"凡使（贝齿）先用苦酒与蜜相对秤，二味相和，将贝齿于酒蜜中蒸，取出，却于清酒中淘令净，研用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-605fbe2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-605fbe2","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-9iw4rb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-9iw4rb1","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，凉."}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-e13lz42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-e13lz42","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-funblfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-funblfd","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《日华子本草》：\"凉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-cs45hdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-cs45hdb","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-amwo2dk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-amwo2dk","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热，利尿。治伤寒热狂，水气浮肿，淋痛溺血，小便不通，鼻渊脓血，目翳，痢疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-68rzj3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-68rzj3u","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主目翳，腹痛下血，五癃，利水道。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-r0ynd37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-r0ynd37","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"除寒热温疰，解肌，散结热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-labcuor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-labcuor","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"能破五淋，利小便，治伤寒狂热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-8m91i8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-8m91i8k","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《海药本草》：\"主水气浮肿及孩子疳蚀吐乳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-74b60he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-74b60he","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"治鼻渊出脓血，下痢，男子阴疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-4xdldxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-4xdldxn","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-q23980h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-q23980h","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤（宜先煎），2～5钱，或入散剂。外用：研末撒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-x1zn2ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-x1zn2ai","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-xhfd9cw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-xhfd9cw","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治妇人热结成淋，小便引痛，或时溺血，或如小豆汁：贝齿一（二）两，葵子三两，石燕二两，滑石二两。上药捣细罗为散，研过，食前以葱白汤调下-钱。（《圣惠方》）贝齿散）"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-w4h2jkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-w4h2jkn","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治二便关格不通，闷胀：贝齿三枚，甘遂三铢。为末，浆水和服。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-90s64c4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-90s64c4","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治鼻渊脓血：贝子烧研，每酒服二钱，日三服。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-a6h50qn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-a6h50qn","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治下疳阴疮：白海蚆三个，煅红研末搽之。（《简便单方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-v99uue9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-v99uue9","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治目中生息肉、肤翳，稍长欲满目，闭瞳子及生管珠：贝齿（烧末）七枚，真珠等分。上二味合治如粉，以注翳肉上，日三度。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-96ao010","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-96ao010","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治目风热亦，生肤翳：贝齿七枚（烧为末、细研），真珠一分（捣罗末、细研），龙脑（研）半钱。上三味合研如粉，每点如黍米大于翳膜上，日三度。（《圣济总录》贝齿散）"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-lp6lizl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-lp6lizl","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613173730-zbx0ac9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173730-zbx0ac9","updated":"20240613173730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240613173732-0bt1m7o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613173732-0bt1m7o"}},{"ID":"20240613173733-3wjn4oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613173733-3wjn4oy"}}]}